    "turn_text": "All right, New Jersey's very own Elena, Elena Treen in Atlantic City. Thanks for that. All right, I'm joined now here on set. It's with CNN, Sarah Murray, seven four is David Weigel and CNN's Jeff Zellane. Good morning to you all. Happy Mother's Day, especially to the new mother at the table. Thanks for joining us. So just to remind viewers about just the intense week that happened in court last week, Stormy Daniels testified about her alleged sexual encounter with Donald Trump. I described it in detail. She talked about the hush money that came after the Access Hollywood tape, of course, was released. That was right before the 2016 campaign. She was accused by Trump's attorneys by for lying for profit. Look, Trump is clearly distracted by all As you can see from attacking Alvin Bragg, the prosecutor calling him, quote, fat Alvin in this, and also not hitting the campaign trail. Biden has been crisscrossing the country. This is a rare rally for Donald Trump in a blue state. It's clearly having an impact at him in this key moment in the campaign.",
